  "summary": {
    "text": "Mistral Medium, later named Mistral Medium 1.0, was the model behind the mistral-medium endpoint at the beta launch of Mistral AI's API platform, la Plateforme, on 11 December 2023. Mistral AI described it as a prototype model under test; it was offered only through the API, with a 32k context window and text input and output.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "id": "src.mistral.la-plateforme-announcement",
        "locator": "Generative endpoints, Mistral-medium"
      },
