  "notes": "At release Mistral named only the endpoint, mistral-medium, and described the model behind it as a prototype model being tested in a deployed setting; access was a beta of la Plateforme. The changelog of 2024-02-26 says the previous mistral-medium was dated and tagged mistral-medium-2312, and the Au Large post says mistral-medium was kept but not updated that day. The docs later call it Mistral Medium 1.0 (version 23.12). The slug ends in -1 because the family id is mistral.mistral-medium. Prominence milestone is editorial: Mistral called it its highest-quality endpoint and it opens the commercial Medium line."
